      "content": "thanks for that. when u say \"fragmented market dynamics\" for nigeria, do u mean there's a higher level of corruption or just lack of infrastructure? i'm trying to figure out if the unreliability is more about the business ethics or just the physical logistics/gov. basically, is it harder to trust the actual partners there compared to vietnam?",
